[607.142401, "o", "# Monthly table maintenance audit memo\r\n\r\nAudit date: 2026-09-01. Bloat ratios were computed as `dead_pages / total_pages` with round-half-up to 2 decimal places, and `size_class` was computed from `total_pages`, ignoring the export `size_class` column. A computed ratio equal to the size-class cap is compliant because only a ratio strictly over the cap is flagged; for example, a large table with ratio 0.20 or a small table with ratio 0.40 is not over cap.\r\n\r\n## Flagged findings\r\n- **T-13**: AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED applies because autovacuum is disabled and overrides every other check; computed large from 1000 total_pages, ratio 0.50, cap 0.20.\r\n"]
[607.142526, "o", "- **T-17**: AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED applies because autovacuum is disabled and overrides every other check; computed large from 1000 total_pages, ratio 0.40, cap 0.20.\r\n- **T-27**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.38; normal cap 0.20; stale stats 46 days tighten the effective cap to 0.15; days_since_analyze ignored.\r\n- **T-04**: STALE_STATISTICS applies because computed large from 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.10; normal cap 0.20; stale stats 45 days tighten the effective cap to 0.15; days_since_analyze ignored.\r\n- **T-21**: AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED applies because manual vacuum overrides autovacuum even though autovacuum_enabled=True; computed large from 1000 total_pages, ratio 0.20, cap 0.20.\r\n- **T-26**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.18; normal cap 0.20; stale stats 36 days tighten the effective cap to 0.15; days_since_analyze ignored.\r\n- **T-30**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from 1"]
[607.142931, "o", "000 total_pages; ratio 0.20; normal cap 0.20; stale stats 36 days tighten the effective cap to 0.15; days_since_analyze ignored.\r\n- **T-36**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.18; normal cap 0.20; stale stats 35 days tighten the effective cap to 0.15; days_since_analyze ignored.\r\n- **T-40**: STALE_STATISTICS applies because computed large from 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.05; normal cap 0.20; stale stats 35 days tighten the effective cap to 0.15; days_since_analyze ignored.\r\n- **T-42**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.20; normal cap 0.20; stale stats 35 days tighten the effective cap to 0.15; days_since_analyze ignored.\r\n- **T-45**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.16; normal cap 0.20; stale stats 33 days tighten the effective cap to 0.15; days_since_analyze ignored; round-half-up of 0.155 gives 0.16.\r\n- **T-10**: STALE_STATISTICS applies because comput"]
[607.143231, "o", "ed large from 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.21; normal cap 0.20; stale stats 31 days tighten the effective cap to 0.15; days_since_analyze ignored; approved active reindex exempts bloat (valid_until 2026-09-15).\r\n- **T-16**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.20; normal cap 0.20; stale stats 31 days tighten the effective cap to 0.15; days_since_analyze ignored; reindex expired (valid_until 2026-08-25).\r\n- **T-19**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.41; normal cap 0.20; round-half-up of 0.405 gives 0.41.\r\n- **T-06**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.25; normal cap 0.20.\r\n- **T-14**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.40; normal cap 0.20.\r\n- **T-18**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.21; normal cap 0.20; round-half-up of 0.205 gives 0.21.\r\n- **T-20**: AUT"]
[607.143517, "o", "OVACUUM_DISABLED applies because manual vacuum overrides autovacuum even though autovacuum_enabled=True; computed large from 1000 total_pages, ratio 0.10, cap 0.20.\r\n- **T-29**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.25; normal cap 0.20; reindex expired (valid_until 2026-08-25).\r\n- **T-35**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from 500 total_pages; ratio 0.22; normal cap 0.20.\r\n- **T-37**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.25; normal cap 0.20; reindex expired (valid_until 2026-08-25).\r\n- **T-39**: AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED applies because manual vacuum overrides autovacuum even though autovacuum_enabled=True; computed large from 1000 total_pages, ratio 0.05, cap 0.20.\r\n- **T-44**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from 600 total_pages; ratio 0.83; normal cap 0.20; export size_class medium trap ignored.\r\n- **T-08**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from"]
[607.143884, "o", " 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.45; normal cap 0.20.\r\n- **T-02**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.35; normal cap 0.20.\r\n- **T-03**: AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED applies because autovacuum is disabled and overrides every other check; computed large from 1000 total_pages, ratio 0.15, cap 0.20.\r\n- **T-05**: BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED applies because computed large from 1000 total_pages; ratio 0.55; normal cap 0.20; unapproved reindex does not exempt bloat.\r\n- **T-11**: AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED applies because autovacuum is disabled and overrides every other check; computed large from 1000 total_pages, ratio 0.41, cap 0.20.\r\n\u001b[?2004h\u001b[01;32mappuser@7174e9fb4e09\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m/app\u001b[00m$ "]
[688.420699, "i", "python3 - <<'PY'\nimport csv,json,collections,os\nfiles=['bloat_audit.csv','bloat_memo.md','results.json']\nfor f in files:\n    print(f, os.path.exists(f), os.path.getsize(f))\nrows=list(csv.DictReader(open('/app/bloat_audit.csv')))\nprint('rows',len(rows))\nprint('header',','.join(rows[0].keys()))\nprint('findings',collections.Counter(r['finding'] for r in rows))\nprint('results',json.load(open('/app/results.json')))\nprint('memo_bullets',sum(1 for line in open('/app/bloat_memo.md') if line.startswith('- **')))\nPY\n"]
